<https://w3id.org/laad/id/arc/catalogo/ficha/ccc-20-12> <https://www.ica.org/standards/RiC/ontology#describesOrDescribed> <https://w3id.org/laad/id/arc/catalogo/expediente/ccc-20-12> <https://w3id.org/laad/grafo/catalogo> .
<https://w3id.org/laad/id/arc/catalogo/ficha/ccc-20-12> <https://www.ica.org/standards/RiC/ontology#isOrWasConstituentOf> <https://w3id.org/laad/id/arc/catalogo/intendencia-tomo-1> <https://w3id.org/laad/grafo/catalogo> .
<https://w3id.org/laad/id/arc/catalogo/ficha/ccc-20-12> <https://www.ica.org/standards/RiC/ontology#scopeAndContent> "Expediente 12. Año: 1822.\nJosé María Loayza, cura titular de Checacupe en el partido de Tinta, ante la justificar ante usted como mejor\nproceda en dicho parezco y digo que me hallo violentamente despojado de esclavos nombrados.\nFolios: 15." <https://w3id.org/laad/grafo/catalogo> .
