<https://w3id.org/laad/id/inferencia/R-don-andres-p18-es-chuquitapa/tiempo> <http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/P82a_begin_of_the_begin> "2026-11-14"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> <https://w3id.org/laad/grafo/argumentacion/R-don-andres-p18-es-chuquitapa> .
